[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4218.83, "timestamp": "01:10:18", "text": "此前，在 Helios 发射期间，靠近运米机"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4221.669, "timestamp": "01:10:21", "text": "虚空物质浓度异常高。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4225.39, "timestamp": "01:10:25", "text": "这给发射造成了问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4229.11, "timestamp": "01:10:29", "text": "原因不明，但茂木教授把它带回来了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4233.03, "timestamp": "01:10:33", "text": "我把它和该设备的某个变体进行比较后就明白了。 WHO"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4237.35, "timestamp": "01:10:37", "text": "这是人为造成的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4248.229, "timestamp": "01:10:48", "text": "赫尔森教授，我真的什么都不记得了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4255.75, "timestamp": "01:10:55", "text": "没必要这么紧张。卢西勒教授"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4258.83, "timestamp": "01:10:58", "text": "我听说他已被洗清嫌疑。"}]